{"id":"escondite","lemma":"escondite","pos":"noun","rank":3314,"glosses":["hiding place","hide and seek","hideout, lair"],"ipa":"/eskonˈdite/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"escondites"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-escondite.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quieres jugar al escondite?","en":"Do you want to play hide and seek?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803582","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to play"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Ellos hicieron del sótano su escondite.","en":"They hid in the cellar.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"cellar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Tom salió de su escondite.","en":"Tom came out of his hiding place.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806237","words":[null,{"g":"to go out","l":"salir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Cuando era niño, solíamos jugar bastante al escondite.","en":"When I was a kid, we used to play hide and seek quite a lot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803583","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"child, boy"},{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to play"},{"g":"quite"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Pensé que habíamos encontrado el escondite perfecto, pero la policía nos encontró.","en":"I thought we had found the perfect hiding place, but the police found us.","words":[{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"found"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"perfect"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"}]}]}